                                "sense_id": "4ad34d8a-1855-3477-b49b-658083141be7",
                                "text": "Four Nottidge sisters fell under the sway of the Agapemone cult, and lived in a commune whose megalomaniac leader forced them to marry his henchmen but forbade consummation of these unions: arguably, they did need rescuing."
                            }
                        ]
